    "title": "Word Search Block Puzzle Game",
    "description": "If you love to find words, try word crush games designed to assist train your brain, relieve stress, and expand your vocabulary\uff01\r\n\r\nThese incredibly addicting word crush puzzle game are brain blasting fun!  Every puzzle you complete will help you study vocabulary and relax!\r\n\r\nFind words on board & connect  letters to solve tons of word puzzle levels. Word crush is no doubt an easy and handy way to sharpen your mind.\r\n\r\nWORD CRUSH FEATURES:\r\n-Swipe up, down, left or right to connect letters. Simple!\r\n-CHALLENGE your vocabulary.\r\n-Great brain training exercises!\r\n-Lots of word game levels. Play 1000s puzzle board levels.\r\n-EARN POWER-UPS. Use boosters to find  words when you get stuck.\r\n-These word crush are easy at the start, but get challenging fast!\r\n\r\nWHY WORD CRUSH?\r\n\r\nIf you like to relax and unwind with word puzzle game \u2014you\u2019ll love this word crush game! It\u2019s easy at first, but gets challenging fast. Are you able to beat the word crush game? Start playing and find out!\r\n\r\nWords crush game could be a modern twist on classic word search puzzles, combining the features of crossword, scrabble style, word find, and word connect puzzle games. This innovative word crush game is expecting you to join.",
